Fixed: MatrixFree now supports discontinuous elements on 3D meshes with
tetrahedra, wedges, pyramids and hexahedra, also mixed in one mesh and
with hanging faces. Before, face integrals between cells of different
shapes or across hanging faces of non-hexahedral cells could be wrong,
and setting up MatrixFree on such meshes could write out of bounds.
<br>
(Lukas Dreyer, 2026/11/26)
